{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の1st写真集「陽射しのパレード」の裏表紙が公開されました！✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"表紙との組み合わせとか色々拘ったので、是非見てみてね🫶🏻"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は表紙とか決める時にくみとかめいとかおみくにも相談しちゃいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色々話聞いてくれてありがとう〜🥰"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ6WN14SPT4SD0V0NVT2ESWA","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ6WN26X0ZX18ZJBHKRZZWRM","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ6WN39F291938XM62HGWD16","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ6WN4A6H7XTTA6A5BRF3244","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそして秋元康先生から素敵な帯文を頂きました。\nこれを読んた時、凄く嬉しい気持ちになりました😌"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な帯文をありがとうございます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ6WN5MR665E3KX4X90KXYYH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそして先行カットで色々公開されていますので是非X「@panchanbook」で調べてみてね〜✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ6WN6N6QXY0H8KTAA2C01RS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目玉焼き焼こうと思ったけど、あまりにもフライパンにくっついてしまい失敗した私😂"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに普段はわざとキミは割ってしっかり焼きたいタイプです😚✌🏻"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ6WN7PGTF8W5DJJECK0C98J","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日公開されたのはサンセットビーチでの写真です🏖"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドレスのまま海の中に入っちゃいました！😊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発売まで2週間をきってわくわくな気持ちです。\n今年はお誕生日より写真集発売ってことの方が自分の中では大きい気がするな〜☺️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色んな表情の私が沢山詰まった写真集、ぜひ色んな方に見て頂きたいなと思います🫶🏻"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#ぱんちゃんぶっく"}],"source":"archive"}